# =============================================================================
# BUILD 08 (FAILED ATTEMPT): Native HTTP/TCP Socket Server in Pure Intent
# =============================================================================

Sessions is a collection.
Each session has a token (text), a user_id (text) and a hits (number).
No two sessions share the same token.
If a session already exists, replace it.

# FAILURE 1: No networking / HTTP / socket concepts in lexicon.py
listen on port 8080 and serve sessions over http.

# FAILURE 2: Cannot chain "increment hits AND return the updated session" in one command
# ("is this a change or a query?" in parser.py:937)
touch-and-get: increase hits by 1 and show the session for sessions whose token is a given token.
